lace3", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "替换3"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "CR Text Replace", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [276.84210205078125, 300.6316223144531], "pos": [-584.4027099609375, 0.5501652956008911], "id": 12015, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text Replace"}, "order": 13}, {"outputs": [{"name": "string", "links": [28], "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["Create a breathtaking, hyper-realistic photograph of a 1/7 scale, living, breathing person embodying the character [character]. This is not a toy or a figure, but a magically shrunken, real being.\n\n**Living Subject Details:**\n- **Realism:** Utterly photorealistic. The subject has authentic skin texture, complete with pores, subtle veins, and micro-wrinkles. Muscle definition is natural and anatomical. The costume is made of real, tangible materials (e.g., real cloth, weathered leather, metallic surfaces).\n- **Pose:** A dynamic and iconic action pose that is characteristic of the character, full of life and energy.\n- **Base:** The person stands on a simple, circular, transparent acrylic base, as if being presented as a living art piece.\n\n**Environment:**\n- **Setting:** A modern and clean computer desk setup.\n- **Computer:** In the background, a high-end computer monitor is displaying the ZBrush software interface, showing the 3D modeling process of this exact character's form.\n- **Packaging:** Next to the monitor, place a BANDAI-style collectible toy packaging box. The box art features the original 2D artwork of [character]. The presence of the box creates a surreal 'art vs. reality' contrast with the living subject next to it.\n- **Lighting:** Use professional studio lighting to highlight the subject's realistic features, creating dramatic shadows and authentic skin/material reflections. The overall mood should be premium and awe-inspiring.\n- **Camera:** Shot with a DSLR camera aesthetic, f/1.8 aperture, creating a shallow depth of field that keeps the living subject in sharp focus while slightly blurring the background elements."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [325.2021179199219, 352.5216369628906], "pos": [-918.4754638671875, 5.0150465965271], "id": 12010, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["To create this stunningly surreal and hyper-realistic image, the scene would be designed to perfectly blend fantasy and reality, showcasing the impossibility of the living, shrunken 蜘蛛侠 (Spider-Man) in a grounded, believable setting. Here's how the image would unfold visually:\n\n---\n\n**Main Subject:**\nThe living, breathing 1/7 scale 蜘蛛侠 stands proudly on the transparent acrylic base, positioned atop a sleek, modern computer desk. He is captured mid-action, striking an iconic pose: one leg bent and perched slightly forward, the other extended behind him for balance, as he crouches dramatically. His arms are wide, one hand forming Spider-Man's trademark web-slinging gesture, the other gripping an invisible strand of web as if mid-swing. His head is tilted slightly upward, exuding determination and energy.\n\nThe costume is a masterpiece of realism, crafted from tangible materials. The red sections of the suit have a finely textured, cloth-like surface with visible stitching, while the blue areas are sleek and slightly glossy, resembling high-tech athletic wear. The black webbing pattern is embossed onto the fabric, catching the light in subtle ways. The iconic spider emblem on his chest is raised and made of matte black leather, with faint scratches and imperfections that suggest wear and tear from heroic battles. His mask perfectly hugs his face, with the white eye lenses reflecting the studio lights subtly, giving them a realistic glass-like appearance.\n\nHis skin is visible where the costume ends—around the neck and wrists—and is rendered with incredible detail. Tiny pores, the faint sheen of natural oils, and the barely-there fuzz of peach fuzz make him undeniably alive. Veins and muscle definition subtly show under the skin, adding anatomical authenticity.\n\n---\n\n**Environment Details:**\nThe desk setup is clean and modern, with a matte black surface and minimalistic design. Behind 蜘蛛侠, a high-end monitor displays the ZBrush software interface. On the screen, the exact 3D model of 蜘蛛侠 in his current pose is visible, showcasing the intricate digital sculpting process. The on-screen model is zoomed in, revealing the wireframe and textured details that match the living subject perfectly, reinforcing the surreal juxtaposition of art and reality.\n\nTo the side of the monitor, a pristine BANDAI-style collectible toy box is placed upright. The box features vibrant, professional artwork of 蜘蛛侠 in the same dynamic pose, but in a stylized 2D comic art style. The packaging includes metallic foil accents and Japanese text, lending an authentic collectible feel. The box's presence deepens the surreal narrative—this living, breathing person could somehow be \"packaged\" as a collectible item.\n\n---\n\n**Lighting and Camera:**\nThe lighting is expertly executed to highlight every detail of the subject. A key light from above creates dramatic shadows on the desk and accentuates the textures of the costume, skin, and base. Fill lights soften the shadows slightly, ensuring no detail is lost. Rim lighting outlines 蜘蛛侠, separating him from the slightly blurred background and creating a cinematic glow around his form.\n\nThe camera captures the scene with a DSLR aesthetic, using an f/1.8 aperture to create a shallow depth of field. 蜘蛛侠 is sharply in focus, while the monitor, toy box, and desk fade into